1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,660
回你波斯顿老家前.
I still think we should call first...

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:06,420
还是先打个电话过去吧
before we go all the way to Boston to see your folks.

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,460
杰森，他们会不让我们去的
Jason, they'd just tell us not to come.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:12,330
爸爸，让我来帮你们拿
Oh, here, let me. I'll get those for you, Dad.

5
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,620
凯罗，亲爱的，我们要走了
Carol, honey, we're almost ready.

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,140
你在跟我说话吗？
Were you speaking to me?

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,880
怎么行程安排一直没告诉我
No one spoke to me when this trip was being planned.

8
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:25,540
我们也是昨晚才知道的
Honey, we didn't know we were going until last night.

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,200
凯罗，我们很担心外公外婆
Carol, we're worried about Grandma and Grandpa.

10
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,680
麦姬，你过虑了
Oh, Maggie, I think you're overreacting.

11
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:33,840
他们干嘛临时取消来访？
Then why did they call and cancel their trip at the last minute?

12
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:36,360
爸爸干嘛说“一切安好”
And why did my dad say everything was "swell"?

13
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,760
因为一切安好？
Because it is?

14
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:43,780
不，我爸从来不说“安好” “妥当”，“不错”这些词
No, Jason. My father doesn't use words like "swell," "good," or "nice."

15
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,900
有我在场时从来不说
Certainly not when I'm in the room.

16
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:49,620
走吧!
Let's go, let's go, let's go!

17
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:51,860
本，很兴奋？
Well, you sure are excited about this, Ben.

18
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:55,260
是啊，外公会让我玩他的警棍.
Are you kidding? Grandpa's gonna let me use his nightstick...

19
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:58,180
手铐，甚至警章
and his handcuffs, and even wear his badge.

20
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:01,320
也会还会让你打手印
Hey, maybe you'll get fingerprinted, too.

21
00:01:01,925 --> 00:01:03,386
太棒了!
Wow!

22
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:07,980
爸，再次谢谢你让我留在家.
Well, Dad, again, I just want to thank you for letting me stay home...

23
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:10,840
帮萨克先生的草坪施肥赚点零用钱
and earn some extra money helping Mr. Sacks fertilize his lawn.

24
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:14,740
赚钱能让我知道钱的价值
I'm sure that earning money will teach me a new respect for the dollar...

25
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:16,560
让我长大成人
and help me grow as a person.

26
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:20,160
施肥你确实很在行
Bet you'll be pretty good at spreading manure, too.

27
00:01:21,612 --> 00:01:25,850
可惜不能在外婆的钢琴伴奏下唱歌
And I'm so sorry that I'm going to miss that sing-along around Grandma's piano.

28
00:01:25,850 --> 00:01:27,413
是啊
Yeah.

29
00:01:29,740 --> 00:01:32,140
记住，若是碰上麻烦.
Well, just remember, if you have any problems here...

30
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,700
打电话给隔壁的库斯曼家
you call the Koosmans next door.

31
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:36,160
今晚不许留宿多过一个人
And only one guest stays over tonight.

32
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:38,500
太不公道了
This is not fair.

33
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:42,740
没有人在乎凯罗还有别的事情
No one thought that old Carol might have other plans.

34
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:45,200
屋子里没一个人.
No one in this entire house...

35
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:49,040
把我当作是一个活生生的人
treated me like a real, living, breathing human person.

36
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:50,880
凯罗，上车
Carol, get in the car.

37
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:53,240
宝贝，再见
Bye, sweetheart.

38
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:57,180
麦克，这里会一切安好
Oh, and, Mike, I know everything will be fine, because if it isn't...

39
00:01:57,820 --> 00:01:59,280
不然我把你关到35岁
you'll be grounded until you're 35.

40
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:01,280
够了够了
Enough said.

41
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:04,740
-爸妈，再见 -麦克，明天见
- Bye, Mom. Bye, Dad. - See you tomorrow, Mike.

42
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,360
玩得开心点，再见
All right. Have fun. Bye-bye.

43
00:02:10,828 --> 00:02:13,358
太好了!
Yes!

44
00:02:13,577 --> 00:02:17,255
(English Subtitle) Growing.Pains.S01E20 -= Be.A.Man =- Subripped by zerox

45
00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:17,780
-本，等等我们 -我要上厕所
- Ben, wait for us. - I got to go to the bathroom.

46
00:03:19,580 --> 00:03:21,540
我们一起给外公外婆惊喜
We want to surprise Grandma and Grandpa together.

47
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:24,440
若外公现在搜我身.
If Grandpa starts frisking me before I go...

48
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:26,080
我就会让他惊喜
I'll surprise him, all right.

49
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:31,698
-嗨 -嗨
- Hi. - Hi.

50
00:03:31,909 --> 00:03:35,133
我是埃德和凯特的女儿麦姬
I'm Ed and Kate's daughter, Maggie.

51
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:38,180
好，失陪了
Good. Excuse us, please.

52
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:41,040
你们就这么走进去吗？
Should you just walk in there like that?

53
00:03:42,087 --> 00:03:44,060
难道要敲门.
What, we should knock and stand out here in the cold...

54
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:45,580
然后站在寒风中等人来开门
waiting for some jerk to open the door?

55
00:04:07,940 --> 00:04:08,360
进来吧
Come on.

56
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:08,460
什么人？
Who are they?

57
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:08,560
妈妈，这些就是圣诞节不送卡片的亲戚？
Mom, are these people the relatives you don't send Christmas cards to?

58
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:08,660
我要去找外公外婆
I'm going to try to find Grandma and Grandpa.

59
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:09,069
你们好，快进来
Oh! How are you folks? Come on in.

60
00:04:09,860 --> 00:04:11,040
行李也带来了？
I see you brought your luggage.

61
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:14,040
别着急，入夜前就能买下来
Well, don't worry, we'll try to close this deal by nightfall.

62
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:17,800
孩子也带来了，太好了 吃热狗吗？
The kiddies, too. This is so nice. Cocktail frank?

63
00:04:18,540 --> 00:04:19,980
我不吃狗
My name's not Frank.

64
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,500
-你是谁？ -我是谁？
- Who are you? - Who am I?

65
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:26,560
我不认识你，也不认识这些人
I don't know you. I don't know him.

66
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,820
我是梦幻房地产的哈里
Harry Bittle. Great American Dream Realty Company.

67
00:04:30,300 --> 00:04:33,020
-这房子要卖掉？ -是的
- This house is for sale? - Yes.

68
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,860
房主在哪？
Where are the owners?

69
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,640
房主未曾露面
Oh, well, the sellers are never present for the showing.

70
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:40,380
住了30年，有感情
Especially sellers who have put 30 years into a place.

71
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:43,660
-倒是会触景生情 -是的
- This would break their heart. - I'm sure.

72
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:49,080
-现在还没有买主 -你们对房子有兴趣？
- Well, honey, they haven't sold it yet. - You folks are interested in this house?

73
00:04:49,921 --> 00:04:51,160
当然了
Deeply.

74
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:54,480
让我指出这栋古色古香的房子的优点
Oh. Well, then let me point out some of the fine features of this timeless classic.

75
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:58,580
-别说了，我要哭了 -什么？
- If you do, I'm going to cry. - Pardon?

76
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:01,440
为什么要卖？
Why are they selling?

77
00:05:02,020 --> 00:05:04,240
不想听听关于房子的事？
You're not interested in hearing about the house?

78
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:05,920
我爱这栋房子
I love this house.

79
00:05:06,638 --> 00:05:10,580
我就在这个火炉旁做功课 等爸爸下班回来.
I'd do my homework right by the fireplace, waiting for my daddy to come home...

80
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,980
放下枪，给我一个拥抱
and hang up his gun and give me a hug.

81
00:05:14,340 --> 00:05:15,540
房主为什么要卖？
Why are they selling?

82
00:05:16,448 --> 00:05:20,467
这是保密的
Well, I can't really violate their confidence.

83
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:23,120
可以说是.
But I will say, retirement income...

84
00:05:23,455 --> 00:05:25,745
退休金泡汤
balloon payment, disaster.

85
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:32,100
-没事，我是她的心理医生 -能效劳吗？
- It's all right. I'm her psychiatrist. - Well, can I do anything?

86
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:35,760
请让我们单独一阵子，谢谢
Yes, you could just give us a moment alone, please. Thank you.

87
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:39,760
麦姬，甜心，我们去弄个清楚
Come on, Maggie, sweetheart, come on, we'll look into this.

88
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:42,220
要卖掉房子肯定很难受
Selling this house has to be breaking their hearts.

89
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:44,000
我知道，但为什么不找我们帮忙？
I know. Why didn't they come to us for help?

90
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:45,840
爸爸自尊心强
Oh, my father's pride.

91
00:05:46,278 --> 00:05:48,240
他怎么会跟我们要钱.
There is no way he could ask us for money, knowing...

92
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:50,760
尤其他又这样看待你的工作
the way he feels about what you do for a living.

93
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:55,180
-什么？ -没什么
- What? - Forget I said that.

94
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:59,700
我知道他不喜欢我 想不到也不喜欢我的职业
I knew he didn't care for me. I didn't think he hated my entire profession.

95
00:06:00,192 --> 00:06:02,480
他不是讨厌你的职业
Oh, honey, it's not that he hates your profession.

96
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,240
他只是不了解
It's just that he doesn't know what it is.

97
00:06:05,397 --> 00:06:06,220
Oh.

98
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:09,060
17年了，现在才告诉我？
So now, after 17 years, I find this out?

99
00:06:10,060 --> 00:06:13,400
他以为你只是个江湖郎中，所以.
Now, what good would it have done to let you know that he thinks you're a quack?

100
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,180
江湖郎中？
A quack?

101
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:19,200
杰森，这个以后再谈吧
Jason, can we talk about this later?

102
00:06:19,820 --> 00:06:23,380
见到二老前 我不希望房子已经被卖掉
Now, I don't want this house sold until we get a chance to talk to Mom and Dad.

103
00:06:23,860 --> 00:06:24,820
好的
Sure, sure.

104
00:06:26,219 --> 00:06:29,907
原木制造，塑料密钉花边
Genuine lath and plaster on real two-by-four studs.

105
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:32,100
不好意思，打断一下.
Excuse me. I don't mean to interrupt, Harry...

106
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:32,660
说吧
No problem.

107
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:35,280
刚才你的话我没听明白
What you were saying over there confused me.

108
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:39,060
尸体是在这里还是那边的房间里发现的？
Were the victims' bodies found in this room or all through the house?

109
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:53,040
-这才叫做人生 -麦克!
- This is life as it should be. - Mike!

110
00:06:54,279 --> 00:06:56,034
麦克!
Mike!

111
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,560
太棒了
Man, that was good.

112
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,180
大伙也来得太早了
Guys, how you doing? You're early.

113
00:07:04,220 --> 00:07:05,240
比萨饼还没订呢
I didn't even order the pizza yet.

114
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:08,360
我去吧，我表哥在店里，会有折扣
Let me do it. My cousin Gus works for Paradise Pizza. I can get us a discount.

115
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,220
-好吧 -今晚有何安排？
- All right. - So, Mikey, what's the action?

116
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:14,100
随便吧，吃比萨，看电视
Not much. Not much. We're gonna eat a little pizza, watch a little TV.

117
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:17,800
看电视？麦克，家里又没人!
TV? Mike, your folks ain't home.

118
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:21,100
千载难逢的机会就看电视？
This is, like, the chance of a lifetime, and you wanna watch TV?

119
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:24,360
节目已经开始了
It's already started.

120
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,311
麦克，你怎么.
Mike, what could be so important that...

121
00:07:26,311 --> 00:07:27,634
哇!
Wow!

122
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:30,870
怎么画面变黄色了？
So, like, when did you get cable?

123
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:35,040
好啊，他说比萨饼可以免费
This is great. Gus says he'll let us have the pizzas for nothing...

124
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:35,920
太好了!
All right!

125
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:38,120
如果他能带几个人过来的话
...if he and a couple of friends can stop by after work.

126
00:07:38,523 --> 00:07:40,326
几个？人多了恐怕.
Yo, how many? Because I don't think we should...

127
00:07:40,326 --> 00:07:44,049
-有妞呢 -好!
- He mentioned women. - All right!

128
00:07:58,140 --> 00:08:01,440
这次旅行真有意思
Is the rest of the trip going to be this much fun?

129
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:06,120
凯罗，带本去外公的房间看电视吧
Carol, why don't you and Ben go watch TV in Grandpa's den?

130
00:08:06,653 --> 00:08:07,240
好的!
Great!

131
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:10,380
你当然好了，有我陪你
Sure, it's great for you. You get to spend time with me.

132
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:14,060
本，别碰外公的警察装备
Ben, don't you go touching any of your grandpa's police stuff.

133
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,420
放心好了
You know me.

134
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,840
杰森，我们要帮他们
Jason, we've got to help them.

135
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:22,000
但是你爸不要我们帮
I'm not so sure your dad wants our help.

136
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,680
话说回来，我算什么？ 我只是个江湖郎中
Then again, what do I know? I'm just a licensed quack.

137
00:08:25,037 --> 00:08:27,407
-杰森 -不许动!
- Oh, Jason. - Freeze, slimebag!

138
00:08:27,407 --> 00:08:28,840
爸爸？
Daddy?

139
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:31,020
埃德，差点打着杰森了
Ed, you almost shot Jason.

140
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,940
他们不该在这里出现
Well, they're not supposed to be here.

141
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,820
我是说这里应该没人的
No one's supposed to be here.

142
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:42,840
妈妈，还好吗？看到你真高兴
Mom, how are you? It's so good to see you.

143
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:44,000
我很好
I'm fine.

144
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:48,600
是不是你们说了要来，但我忘了？
Did you say you were coming, and I forgot?

145
00:08:49,162 --> 00:08:53,340
-妈，没有 -埃德，幸会
- No, Mom, no. - Ed, always a pleasure to see you.

146
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:55,000
爸爸，爸爸!
Daddy, Daddy, Daddy!

147
00:08:56,003 --> 00:08:57,859
小可爱!
Pumpkin!

148
00:08:57,920 --> 00:09:00,460
你怎么要卖房子了？
So, what's this about selling the house?

149
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:02,480
这个.
Well...

150
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:05,220
我们打算过点退休的生活
we thought we'd do this retirement thing right.

151
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:08,100
搬到小一点的地方去住
Move into a smaller place with less upkeep.

152
00:09:08,540 --> 00:09:09,360
住公寓
A condo.

153
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:13,500
-爷爷!奶奶! -凯罗，宝贝!
- Grandma! Grandpa! - Carol, honey!

154
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,340
长这么大了!
Look how she's grown.

155
00:09:17,980 --> 00:09:19,160
小麦克呢？
Where's Mikey?

156
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:21,840
麦克没有来
Mike couldn't come.

157
00:09:22,228 --> 00:09:23,320
爷爷!
Grandpa!

158
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,860
-是本吗？ -是的
- Is that Benny? - Yes.

159
00:09:25,740 --> 00:09:26,700
小心
Look out.

160
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:31,360
举手投降出来吧
All right, come out with your hands up.

161
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:35,580
不行，凯罗把我铐在椅子上了
I can't. Carol handcuffed me to the chair.

162
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:41,920
把风，我去收拾他
Watch the door. I'm gonna rough him up.

163
00:09:43,483 --> 00:09:45,374
抓到你了
Got you.

164
00:09:45,552 --> 00:09:48,341
住手，等着瞧
Stop it. Wait till I get you.

165
00:09:48,855 --> 00:09:50,700
本，我们去做饭吧
Well, we're going to fix a little dinner. Come on, Ben.

166
00:09:50,700 --> 00:09:52,180
让爸爸跟外公聊聊
Let your dad and granddad talk.

167
00:09:53,460 --> 00:09:54,580
-我看用不着了 -本就留下玩吧
- I don't think that'll be necessary. - No, he can play here.

168
00:09:56,220 --> 00:09:58,920
本，跟其他犯人去削土豆
Come on, Ben. You can peel potatoes with the other prisoners.

169
00:09:59,900 --> 00:10:01,060
Wow!

170
00:10:09,843 --> 00:10:11,596
爸爸.
Daddy...

171
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:14,320
若是你们有经济困难，我们.
if you and Mom are having financial problems, we would be...

172
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:16,680
没有，经济很好
No. Things are swell.

173
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:19,540
一切安好，好极了
They're fine, even good.

174
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:24,157
不管需要多少钱，我和杰森.
Dad, any money you need, Jason and I would be more than happy to...

175
00:10:24,157 --> 00:10:25,800
麦姬.
Maggie...

176
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:28,180
小姑娘，别忘了.
just in case you can't remember, little girl.

177
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:33,140
我不是有能力养了你18年吗？
I kept a roof over your head and food on the table for over 18 years.

178
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:35,480
直到他把你带走了
Till he came along, anyway.

179
00:10:36,003 --> 00:10:37,400
爸爸
Daddy.

180
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:39,800
见鬼，我现在还能养活你妈妈和我自己
Damn it, I can still take care of your mom and myself...

181
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:41,320
不需要谁的施舍
without your charity!

182
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:43,780
埃德，埃德.
Ed, Ed, please...

183
00:10:44,780 --> 00:10:47,720
你总不能因为对我有偏见而.
there's no reason for you to turn down this offer just because of...

184
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:50,060
-拒绝我们的帮助 -杰森，别提了
- how you feel about me. - Jason, let's not mention...

185
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:52,480
不，你爸爸应该不计前嫌.
No, no, no. Your dad should overcome his feelings about me...

186
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,880
保住这栋房子
and save this house.

187
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:56,740
干嘛为了这种盲目的自尊.
Why hurt your wife, your daughter, yourself...

188
00:10:56,740 --> 00:10:59,360
而伤害老婆，女儿和自己？
all in the name of some foolish pride?

189
00:11:00,594 --> 00:11:02,279
盲目？
Foolish?

190
00:11:02,780 --> 00:11:05,160
别用江湖郎中那一套对待我
Don't use your shrink talk on me.

191
00:11:06,620 --> 00:11:10,700
我是不会要你的钱的，除非我死了
The day I accept one dime of your money will be the day they bury me.

192
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,940
进行挺顺利的吧？
I think that went well, don't you?

193
00:11:28,856 --> 00:11:30,580
杰里.
Yeah, Jerry, listen.

194
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:34,820
把布鲁斯叫来，罗宾路有派对
Call Bruce Vinaker. Tell him party central's at 15 Robin Hood Lane.

195
00:11:36,900 --> 00:11:38,340
你是懒虫吗？
Excuse me, Slug, is it?

196
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,380
别再请人来了
I don't think we should invite any more people.

197
00:11:42,170 --> 00:11:44,260
你是怎么了？你不知道？
Well, what's it to you? Didn't you hear?

198
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:46,980
那个大款的家人出城去了
The bozo that lives here? Parents are out of town.

199
00:11:49,409 --> 00:11:51,765
-大款？你.. -麦克!
- Bozo? Hey, listen... - Hey, Mike!

200
00:11:52,578 --> 00:11:55,340
记得我吗？我是琳达
Remember me? Lynda McManus!

201
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:57,180
记得一起学空手道吗？
We had a karate class together.

202
00:11:57,180 --> 00:12:01,020
当然记得了，你的铁掌可厉害了
Yeah, yeah, of course I remember you. You have got killer hands.

203
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,680
-我的意思是.. -我懂你的意思
- I mean, I didn't mean... - I know what you mean.

204
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:05,780
麦克，过来
Mike, come here.

205
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:10,580
-失陪一分钟 -一分钟就好了
- Would you excuse me for just a second? - Okay. But just for a second.

206
00:12:11,999 --> 00:12:13,286
埃迪!
Eddie!

207
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:16,340
里面有两个人在吐.
Michael, there are two guys out back throwing up...

208
00:12:16,340 --> 00:12:17,460
楼上还有个家伙在刮毛
and a guy upstairs shaving.

209
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:20,560
这真是个无拘无束的派对
I mean, this has gotta be the coolest party I've ever been to.

210
00:12:20,774 --> 00:12:22,027
刮毛？
Shaving?

211
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:25,580
麦克，给我几块钱 你妈妈的车子没油了
Mike, I need a couple of bucks. Your mom's car ran out of gas.

212
00:12:25,580 --> 00:12:27,720
你不能用我妈妈的车
Eddie, you can't take my mom's car.

213
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:29,500
不是我，是弗兰克
I didn't. Frank did.

214
00:12:30,460 --> 00:12:31,080
弗兰克是谁？
Who's Frank?

215
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:33,940
-我以为你认识他呢 -不认识
- I thought you knew him. - No.

216
00:12:35,055 --> 00:12:38,400
送比萨那人的车子启动不了 所以他打电话叫弗兰克.
All right, Gus' pizzamobile wouldn't start, right? So he calls Frank...

217
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,920
要我们自己去取比萨
and says we'd have to pick up our own pizzas...

218
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,060
看在免费的份上，希望顺便送几趟货
and since they're free, could we make a couple of deliveries?

219
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,720
用我妈妈的车？
In my mom's car?

220
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:46,120
-弗兰克该怎么办？ -弗兰克.
- What was Frank supposed to do? - What was Frank...

221
00:12:46,620 --> 00:12:48,580
弗兰克该怎么办？
What was Frank supposed to do?

222
00:12:49,300 --> 00:12:50,920
好吧，没关系
All right. Relax, babe. It's under control.

223
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:53,780
你就给点油钱吧
Now, just give me a little gas money.

224
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:15,520
妈妈，让爸爸收钱吧 这房子你也有份
Mom, make Dad take the money. It's your home, too.

225
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:17,460
你爸爸说了算
Well, your father's the boss.

226
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:21,620
结婚当日我承诺过嫁夫随夫
And on our wedding day, I promised to love, honor and obey.

227
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:27,280
妈妈，妈妈.. “三从四德”对现代女性来说只是个词语
Mom, Mom, Mom, every modern woman knows "obey" is just a figure of speech.

228
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:30,760
所以才有这么多现代女性离婚
Maybe that's why every modern woman seems to get divorced.

229
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:35,520
凯特，孩子们围在钢琴边，等你弹奏呢
Kate, the kids are glued to the piano, they're waiting for one of your songs.

230
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:38,640
好呀，我弄到一首歌<青春玉女>
Oh, good. I just got the sheet music to Like a Virgin.

231
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:43,540
其实他们是被铐在钢琴边
Actually, they're not glued, they're handcuffed.

232
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:50,140
杰森，我说服不了妈妈 要看咱们了，你怎么看？
Oh, Jason, I got nowhere with my mother. It's up to us. What are we going to do?

233
00:13:50,598 --> 00:13:53,955
我怎么看？无计可施
What are we going to do? I don't have the slightest idea.

234
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,780
不能眼睁睁卖掉房子，无非是6千块
We can't let them lose their home. Jason, all they need is $6,000.

235
00:13:57,860 --> 00:14:00,460
我们不是不愿、意给钱，有说错吗？
Well, correct me if I'm wrong. Didn't we just offer your father money?

236
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:04,380
一句“除非我死了”就让你放弃了？
And you're giving up just because he said he'd rather be dead?

237
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:10,580
-他这样我还能怎样？ -好吧
- Forgive me. What was I thinking? - That's better. Okay.

238
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,500
你有什么计划？
So, what's your plan?

239
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:15,360
我没有计划
I don't have a plan.

240
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:19,460
没有计划就行动是不明智的
Do you think it's wise to proceed without a plan?

241
00:14:43,985 --> 00:14:46,920
-这歌刚放过 -好了啦
- We just heard this record. - That's okay.

242
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,400
乐队马上就来了
The band should be here any minute.

243
00:14:52,461 --> 00:14:54,820
邦纳，场面失去控制了
Boner, this party is completely out of control.

244
00:14:54,820 --> 00:14:56,180
知道了，恭喜你
I know, man. Congratulations.

245
00:14:56,898 --> 00:15:00,368
我得想想办法 但不能让人觉得我胆小
No, man, I gotta do something about it without everybody thinking I'm a wimp.

246
00:15:00,368 --> 00:15:03,827
麦克，别急，今晚要破派对记录了
Relax, Mikey. Tonight, you're making party history.

247
00:15:04,605 --> 00:15:05,697
Hey!

248
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:07,380
老兄!
Hey, bud!

249
00:15:09,812 --> 00:15:12,496
不好意思，请把这个给我
Excuse me, Slug. Mind if I cut in?

250
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,020
我死定了
I'm a dead man.

251
00:15:42,845 --> 00:15:45,802
至少我风流过15年
At least I was cool for 15 years.

252
00:15:45,802 --> 00:15:49,800
警察局？我是.
Hello, police? Yeah. This is...

253
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:54,480
我是甘地先生
Mr. Gandhi. Yes, Bob Gandhi.

254
00:15:55,500 --> 00:16:00,200
我现在住在罗宾路，我热爱和平
Yes, I am a very peace-loving man, and I am living on Robin Hood Lane.

255
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:03,560
这附近一向清静
Yes, it is normally a very peaceful street.

256
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:07,080
今晚15号那里却闹翻天了
But tonight there is a very, very loud party at Number 15.

257
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:10,920
对，就是西弗家
Yes, it is, I believe, the Seaver home.

258
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:13,620
真是难以置信.
Yes, this is very hard to believe...

259
00:16:13,620 --> 00:16:16,660
他们家一向很和睦
since they are such a loving, peaceful family.

260
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:21,500
是的，请好好对待西弗家 那个叫麦克的孩子
Yes. And please be going easy on the Seaver boy called Mike.

261
00:16:21,983 --> 00:16:24,980
他很老实.
He is a very, very spiritual boy...

262
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:27,440
这绝对兴他无关
and none of this could possibly be his fault.

263
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:31,980
还是忙音，麦克打给谁了呢？
Still busy. I wonder who Mike could be talking to.

264
00:16:32,180 --> 00:16:33,660
妈，到你了
Mom, come and take your turn.

265
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:36,100
-对 -我这姿势对吗？
- Yeah. - Am I doing this right?

266
00:16:37,740 --> 00:16:39,540
-他在房间里？ -对
- Is he in his den? - Yeah.

267
00:16:40,820 --> 00:16:44,180
好吧，麦姬，是你叫我想出计划来的
Okay, Maggie. You're the one who wanted me to come up with a plan.

268
00:16:45,039 --> 00:16:46,393
你打算怎样？
What are you going to do?

269
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:47,960
不知道
I have no idea.

270
00:16:51,179 --> 00:16:52,362
埃德？
Ed?

271
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:54,980
又来“大发慈悲”了？
Come to make another generous offer, did you?

272
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:58,500
你又来“心领了”？
Ready with another gracious turndown?

273
00:17:02,540 --> 00:17:06,340
我不是要施舍什么，我是来道歉的
No, I didn't come to offer you anything, Ed, except an apology.

274
00:17:07,529 --> 00:17:08,746
拿着
Here.

275
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:13,620
爱尔兰威士忌？
Irish whiskey?

276
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:19,200
若是给你钱.
Well, you know, I thought that maybe deep down...

277
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:22,440
我内心深处确实有点沾沾自喜
I really did want to embarrass you a little when I offered you that money.

278
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,620
这点我承认
I admit that.

279
00:17:23,780 --> 00:17:24,540
对不起
I'm sorry.

280
00:17:26,900 --> 00:17:27,580
坐下
Sit down.

281
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:31,460
-拿杯子来 -好的
- Grab a couple of glasses there. - Okay.

282
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:35,520
象棋？
Game of checkers?

283
00:17:37,426 --> 00:17:38,779
好啊
Sure.

284
00:17:39,695 --> 00:17:42,413
要调酒吗？
How're we going to get any ginger ale in these?

285
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:47,400
调酒？这是爱尔兰威士忌
Ginger ale? That's Irish, man.

286
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:49,800
-直接喝太呛了 -暴殄天物
- I know you can't drink that straight. - Blasphemy.

287
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:54,580
-口气不小 -不信你看
- Big talk. - Well, you just watch.

288
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:57,400
才这么一小口
One sip. Big deal.

289
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,820
我打赌你喝不完
Bet you can't drain that.

290
00:18:00,060 --> 00:18:00,840
你看着吧
Keep watching.

291
00:18:04,020 --> 00:18:05,180
来吧
You're on.

292
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:14,200
-100块 -这算什么
- $100. - Well, can't be that tough.

293
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,000
赌双倍我也行
Double or nothing says I can do it.

294
00:18:18,267 --> 00:18:19,518
你？
You?

295
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:21,500
赌吧
You're on.

296
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:30,240
我又赢了
I won again.

297
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:32,400
你要给机会我回本
Well, you have to give me a chance to get even.

298
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:34,780
-本，凯罗 -“上床”
- Ben, Carol... - "Go to bed."

299
00:18:35,517 --> 00:18:36,699
对
Right.

300
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:40,880
警察怎么还不来？
Where are the cops? Where are the cops?

301
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,580
在这里跳舞不够宽敞
We need more room to dance.

302
00:18:43,940 --> 00:18:45,700
咱把家具搬到厨房
Let's shove all the furniture into the kitchen.

303
00:18:46,061 --> 00:18:47,585
好啊
Yeah.

304
00:18:53,060 --> 00:18:54,440
麦克，叫你妈妈检查一下刹车
Michael, tell your mother she should have her brakes checked.

305
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:58,960
弗兰克在后座睡了 事先声明，他吐了，我没有
Oh, Frank's asleep in the back seat. And for the record, he puked, not me.

306
00:19:00,820 --> 00:19:02,340
-比萨! -太棒了
- Pizza! - Yeah.

307
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:09,280
够了!
All right, that's it.

308
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:11,500
警察不来，派对也要结束了
Cops or no cops, this party is over.

309
00:19:13,289 --> 00:19:14,971
这下完了
Just like my life.

310
00:19:17,527 --> 00:19:19,016
食物炮弹!
Food fight!

311
00:19:24,767 --> 00:19:28,850
大家够了!
Hey, hey! Come on, people!

312
00:19:31,341 --> 00:19:33,831
够了!住手!
Come on! Hey, stop!

313
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:42,080
我是麦克，这里的主人 我有话要说
Hey, I'm Mike. I'm the bozo giving this party. I got something to say.

314
00:19:42,818 --> 00:19:44,205
装模作样
Big deal.

315
00:19:44,386 --> 00:19:45,377
Hey!

316
00:19:45,521 --> 00:19:47,760
-麦克，做人要厚道 -我不管
- Hey, Mike, yo, this is not cool. - I don't care.

317
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:51,720
我告诉你们，特别是你，懒虫.
I want all of you people, especially you, Slug, to just...

318
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:53,000
警察!开门!
Open up! Police!

319
00:19:56,520 --> 00:20:00,040
谁那么孬种叫警察了？
Oh, nice. Nice. All right, now, who called the police?

320
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:02,860
派对正要进入高潮
Come on, this party was just starting to cook.

321
00:20:03,472 --> 00:20:05,394
天哪!
God!

322
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:15,120
不行了，大叔
No, that's it. Uncle.

323
00:20:15,485 --> 00:20:18,066
最后一次还是输给你了
Beaten me for the last time, Ed.

324
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:21,840
据我记录，你一共输了7次
By my records, you lost seven times.

325
00:20:22,825 --> 00:20:24,994
双倍的双倍，开始是100
Let's see. That's double or nothing, starting at $100.

326
00:20:24,994 --> 00:20:25,740
对
Right.

327
00:20:25,740 --> 00:20:28,820
共6400元
32, $6,400.
1变成2，4，8，16，32
So you owe me... The 1 goes to 2, that's 4, 8, 16...

328
00:20:32,935 --> 00:20:33,127
$6,400?

329
00:20:33,127 --> 00:20:34,890
6400？

330
00:20:35,773 --> 00:20:37,124
什么？
What?

331
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:39,880
是这么多，我也搞不懂
That's what it comes to. I don't get it, either.

332
00:20:40,500 --> 00:20:42,320
你当然不懂了
Oh, sure you don't, Ed.

333
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:46,080
-我服了你了 -这是怎么了？
- No, nice job, you got me. - How did I do that?

334
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:50,700
我才喝了3杯，不过你一杯也没喝完
I only had three shots. You never got all the way through one of yours.

335
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:55,220
你自以为比心理医生聪明吗？
So, Big Ed finally shows the overpaid psychiatrist just who's smarter.

336
00:20:55,580 --> 00:20:57,340
我可不认这个帐
I don't like to be taken, Ed.

337
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:01,000
我骗你了？
I didn't take you.

338
00:21:01,120 --> 00:21:04,460
-我赢得光明正大 -我不给钱
- I won that fair and square. - Well, I'm not paying.

339
00:21:04,940 --> 00:21:07,620
我看你不给!拿钱来!
The hell you're not! I want my money!

340
00:21:09,472 --> 00:21:10,688
怎么了？
Well?

341
00:21:12,900 --> 00:21:15,680
不给6400块，别想出这门
Jason, you're not leaving this house until I get my $6,400.

342
00:21:18,415 --> 00:21:19,220
埃德.
Eddie...

343
00:21:19,220 --> 00:21:23,380
我们保住了房子，也保住了名誉
we get to keep our house, and you get to keep your pride.

344
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,840
我早说过我能照顾你
Hey, I told you I'd take care of you, didn't I?

345
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:34,080
-谢谢你，亲爱的 -刚输了6000大洋
- Thank you, honey. - Hey, I just lost $6,000...

346
00:21:34,780 --> 00:21:36,020
看来饭也吃不成了
and I may lose my lunch.

347
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:39,200
我就知道你能照顾我
I knew you'd take care of me.

348
00:21:48,100 --> 00:21:50,700
警官，谢谢你们 下面我来处理吧
Thanks for your help, Officer. I can handle it from here.

349
00:21:50,820 --> 00:21:53,400
太客气了，甘地先生
You are very, very welcome, Mr. Gandhi.

350
00:22:22,312 --> 00:22:25,063
爸爸妈妈，欢迎回家!
Welcome home, Mom and Dad!

351
00:22:26,082 --> 00:22:27,818
让开!人有三急!
Out of my way! Nature calls!

352
00:22:27,818 --> 00:22:30,020
麦克，周末好玩吗？
Well, Mike. How was your weekend?

353
00:22:30,020 --> 00:22:31,522
过得很无聊
Oh, kind of boring.

354
00:22:31,522 --> 00:22:33,457
你们在外公外婆家好玩吗？
How was your weekend with Grandma and Grandpa?

355
00:22:33,457 --> 00:22:35,124
不错，不错
Oh, fine, fine.

356
00:22:35,124 --> 00:22:37,594
你爸爸是本周英雄呢
Actually, your father was a hero this weekend.

357
00:22:37,594 --> 00:22:38,843
救了一栋房子
He saved a house.

358
00:22:39,029 --> 00:22:40,564
真的？
Oh, really?

359
00:22:40,564 --> 00:22:43,610
-太巧了 -什么？
- What a coincidence. - What?

360
00:22:43,968 --> 00:22:47,704
你们在远方.
You know, it's just nice to know that you guys were up there...

361
00:22:47,704 --> 00:22:49,306
我在这里.
I was down here and...

362
00:22:49,306 --> 00:22:51,328
都很好
Hey, it's a wonderful world.

363
00:22:52,776 --> 00:22:56,027
你还在浇粪？
I thought your manure-spreading job was over yesterday.

364
00:23:05,523 --> 00:23:06,771
哪来的狗？
What dog?

365
00:23:49,695 --> 00:23:50,683
